WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.440
Wow, it's lovely outside today!

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:08.760
Tonight's the Tanabata festival too, so hopefully there'll be lots of stars to wish on...

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.050
Is that...?

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.490
I think it is!

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.860
It's been so long...

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.260
It <i>is</i> you, Po-

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:23.960
Miyuki{-dono}!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.430
Onii-chan!

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.010
Ultra ha-pu-pu...

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:13.760
Only two more strokes and the Bad Energy Memory should be completely filled.

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:18.780
Then, King Pierrot shall return to us,

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.120
and the world will be given its Bad End!

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.800
I am glad to see you are all well, my compatriots-de gozaru.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:40.200
It has been far too long.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:43.220
You're still cute as ever, Pop!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.340
No more of that!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.380
Show me respect!

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:48.190
I am a man!

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.410
A proud man, who strives to cast away the label of "cute"!

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:52.380
Aw, you're so cool!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:57.490
W-Well, I'm not really that...

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:58.840
What the heck are you doin'?

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.320
Onii-chan! Grab my ears-kuru!

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.520
So, what brings you over here, anyway?

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.490
Ah, I'd almost forgotten-de gozaru!

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:08.130
First, allow me to congratulate you on collecting so many Décors-de gozaru.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.470
We've collected fifteen so far, right?{g out numbers in subs, generally, because it usually ends up matching the pacing of the audio better that way.}

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.840
Candy made contact with me, and informed me that only one Cure Décor remained.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.160
I made haste to come and join you-de gozaru.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.540
I phoned him-kuru!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:24.780
Once we get all sixteen of those Décors, we can revive Märchenland's Queen, right?

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.020
Indeed we can!

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:32.390
Her return will mean we can protect Märchenland from the hands of Emperor Pierrot-de gozaru.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:34.360
Emperor Pierrot...

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.560
The one trying to give our world a Bad End...

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.960
The Emperor of Darkness...

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.900
Don't worry!

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.900
We're not going to let him do that to our world!

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:54.160
Look! This book is a fairytale about us, the Precure, see?

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:59.250
There's all these blank pages left. That's our future, and we can shape it how we want to!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:04.420
So let's make it an ultra happy future, full of smiles!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.770
Ultra happy-kuru!

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:10.650
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:11.360
Yup!

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.960
We should start by wishing on a star, then!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.470
What is that, exactly-de gozaru?

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:20.600
It's so pretty-kuru!

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.540
This is bamboo for the Tanabata festival.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.740
Today's Tanabata, you see.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.940
What's Tanabata?

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:32.520
On the 7th of July each year, the fated lovers Hikoboshi and Orihime

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.280
can cross the Milky Way, and be together for one night.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:39.940
It's said that if you write a wish upon a card and hang it from the bamboo,

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.420
that wish will come true.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.800
I wasn't aware you had such legends in your world, too-de gozaru.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:51.300
We have a similar tradition in Märchenland called Pegasus Day-de gozaru.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.770
Pegasus Day?

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.240
You mean this kinda pegasus?

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:57.700
Exactly that kind of pegasus-de gozaru!

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.370
Bam-de gozaru!

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.380
Neigh-de gozaru!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.530
So cool!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.320
I wanna ride you!{That is, in fact, what *she* said.}

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:17.040
Ahem. Once a year, on Pegasus Day, countless shooting stars fill the sky of Märchenland.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:22.540
We light candles, making wishes upon them to the pegasus-like stars soaring through the skies-de gozaru.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:27.470
The legends say that if we do so, the Pegasi will grant our wish-de gozaru.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.470
It does bear a resemblance to Tanabata, doesn't it?

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.530
You picked a good day to come, Pop!

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:37.280
Tonight there's going to be a
once-in-a-century meteor shower!

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.980
Then why don't we celebrate Tanabata and Pegasus Day together!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.410
Why are you riding me?!

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:44.160
Let me have a go!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.750
Me too!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.730
I'm sorry...

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.050
Are you all right-kuru?

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:50.750
A bit too much for my back to take, I'm afraid...

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:51.430
How rude!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.390
Come on, Pop! You'd better write a card out too!

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.530
A card...?

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:59.570
You have to write your wish on a card, and hang it from the bamboo.

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:03.300
And once we've all hung up our cards, we can go watch the meteor shower!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.820
I wanna write a wish too-kuru!

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.240
Can I write as many as I want-kuru?

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:10.400
Of course you can! Whatever you want to wish for!

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.730
Hooray!

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.720
We've already written some, actually.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.420
"I hope we'll be able to revive the Royal Queen."

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.620
"I hope that we can save Märchenland."

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.950
Oh, my-de gozaru!

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:26.690
"I hope I can find a lot of wonderful new stories to enjoy! -Miyuki"

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:30.430
"Bring on the customers, bring on the profit! - Akane"

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:33.540
"I hope I can get even better at drawing. - Yayoi"

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:36.450
"I hope I can go on a vacation with my family. - Nao"

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.930
"I hope the path I follow remains noble and just. - Reika"

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.450
That doesn't sound like much of a wish...

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.350
More like a resolution to me...

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.320
Is that so?

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.870
That's Reika to a tee!

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:48.690
Yeah, true.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:49.860
Right, let's hang these up!

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:50.290
Sure!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.660
Nao! You put those up top!

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:53.530
Okay!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:55.500
Nao, could you take these too?

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.570
It needs a little something extra...

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:59.190
Ah, I've got it!

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:05.830
Perfect!

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.300
It's adorable!

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.880
"I hope we can collect all sixteen Décors-de gozaru."

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.200
"I want lots of cake-kuru!"

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.200
You're certainly enjoying yourself, Candy-de gozaru.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.000
I am-kuru!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:25.550
I think you owe that radiant smile of yours to the wonderful friends you've made, right-de gozaru?

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:30.190
Pop, bring those over when you're done!

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.270
Understood-de gozaru!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.140
Your writing's classy, Pop!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.110
I... I wouldn't say that...

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.710
Miyuki...

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:44.940
Akane...

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.500
Yayoi...

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.230
Nao...

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.200
Reika...

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:58.350
I'm so glad you five are the Precure-kuru!

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.940
<i>You're the bestest-kuru!</i>

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.200
That's it-kuru!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:12.850
"I hope I can play with Miyuki and her friends forever-kuru!"

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:15.800
I'm done-kuru!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.720
Candy!

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.750
We're leaving!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.760
Wait for me-kuru!

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.460
Then let us proceed-de gozaru!

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.440
I knew it...

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:06.060
That fairy might just lead me to the Miracle Jewel after all...

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:12.160
Joker! Why did you waste my time calling me out here-oni?

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:16.300
Akaoni-san! Just the man I've been waiting for!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.610
Beauty!

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.580
Candy!

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.340
Look at that! It's so beautiful!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.790
Wow, look at all the people!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.760
Are they all here to view the meteor shower-de gozaru?

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:49.680
Yeah. This is the best place in town for stargazing!

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.130
Hey, over here!

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:53.420
Let's join them.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.370
Right!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.150
There's a quiet little spot over here!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.510
Ooh, sounds fun!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:58.590
Watch your step, okay?

00:09:58.590 --> 00:09:59.310
Okay!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.920
So pretty... it's like the stars are about to rain down on us...

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.620
It is truly beautiful-de gozaru. It reminds me so much of Märchenland-de gozaru.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.780
Märchenland, huh?

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.180
What's it like, anyway?

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.870
Hopefully, I'll be able to show you all one day-de gozaru.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.330
I can't wait!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.970
You came from Märchenland too, right, Candy?

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.020
Yup-kuru!

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:31.540
When I first met you, Candy, I thought,

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:35.680
"This has to be the start of a really happy adventure!"

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:36.650
Kuru?

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.730
Turns out I was right!

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:44.050
Since I met you, I've made all these wonderful friends.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:47.520
I'm so ultra happy now!

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:48.890
Kuru!

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:51.120
Candy!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.830
That tickles, Miyuki-kuru!

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.980
A shooting star!

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:58.710
Seriously?!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.240
Where!

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:01.860
There it is!

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.210
There's another!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:05.020
Whoa...

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.080
So pretty!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.450
They really do look like a flying pegasus!

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:13.750
That they do.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.010
Come on, guys, make a wish!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:16.600
Kuru?

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.040
If you wish upon a star, your wish will come true!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.190
Really-kuru?!

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:23.160
Yeah, I'm sure it will!

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.320
Then I wish-kuru...

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.900
<i>...that I can stay with Miyuki and her friends forever-kuru...</i>

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:42.680
Please make my wish come true, Mr. Star-kuru!

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:46.020
Hey, what did you write on your cards, anyway, Candy?

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.980
Now that you mention it, we didn't get to see what they said.

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:52.130
Yeah, what did you put, Candy?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.490
Well~

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.360
That's a secret-kuru!

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.550
Oh come on, tell us!

00:12:00.550 --> 00:12:02.060
I wanna know too!

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:03.220
Spill it!

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.880
<i>I know that Candy holds powers we have yet to understand-de gozaru...</i>

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:10.410
<i>For the sake of saving Märchenland, I'll do everything to protect her-de gozaru!</i>

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.470
It's a secret-kuru!

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:14.660
I'm not going to tell you what I wished for-kuru!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:21.380
Don't worry! Your wishes won't be coming true-oni!

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.190
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:29.020
...a Bad End-oni!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.260
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:37.970
The stars are gone!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:48.500
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-oni!

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:55.300
What's with all this wishing garbage-oni?

00:12:56.150 --> 00:13:00.560
Do you seriously believe that the stars are going to grant your wishes-oni?!

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.250
That's hilarious-oni!

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:05.160
What's so funny?!

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:11.900
Wanting to make our wishes come true gives us the strength to believe in a brighter future!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:15.000
Mocking people's wishes is just heartless!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.080
Come on!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:16.770
Right!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.740
Ready?

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.020
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.140
Go!

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.220
Go, go!

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:30.010
Let's go!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.440
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.350
Cure Happy!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.640
Dazzling sun!

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.930
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.020
Cure Sunny!

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:52.290
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:55.250
Cure Peace!

00:14:57.090 --> 00:15:00.540
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.630
Cure March!

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:09.390
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.380
Cure Beauty!

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:16.710
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:27.270
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:33.510
That's more like it, Precure! Today, we end this for good-oni!

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.680
Come out, Akanbe!

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:41.120
Akanbe!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.490
A-ka-n-be!

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.720
<i>This one's</i> sure rarin' for a fight, huh?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.690
It seems our usual tactics may not suffice.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:53.160
But we have to get that last Décor!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.900
Hey, that's right!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.530
This is going to be the final Décor!

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.030
You won't be getting your hands on it-oni!

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:01.720
Get them, Akanbe-oni!

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.210
Akanbe!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.370
Aka!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:08.910
Akakakakaka!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.720
Akanbe!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:23.960
Akakakaka!

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.410
No!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.560
Candy! You have to stay hidden-de gozaru!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:35.120
It seems like you can't handle an Akanbe when it goes full force-oni!

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:37.570
What?!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.230
Akan...

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.990
be!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.350
You can't even touch it-oni!

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:49.290
Just give up already and save us all the trouble-oni!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:53.960
Like hell we're gonna give up!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:17:00.690
We want to revive the Royal Queen... to save Märchenland...!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.630
We all made that wish together!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:06.370
We shall never give up hope! And I know...

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:09.470
We'll keep trying, until our dreams are in sight!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.960
Wish all you want! Your future leads to a Bad End-oni!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.280
Your wishes won't get you anywhere-oni!

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.080
Yes they will!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.080
We've only gotten where we are now by working together!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.230
With our wishes...

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:32.460
...we'll create a future filled with smiles!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.660
And we'll do it together!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:45.340
How ridiculous-oni! Akanbe!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.180
Akan!

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:56.820
Akan-Akanbe!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:00.890
Akan!

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.300
A-Akan!

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.060
Akakakakaka!

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:14.310
Focus, focus...!

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:16.310
Focus!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:20.040
I won't lose to you-oni! Akanbe!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.810
Akanbe!

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:25.160
You can do it, Happy-kuru!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.150
Precure...

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.990
Happy...

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.660
Shower!

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:49.570
Akanbe!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.910
Akanbe, you have to beat them this time-oni!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:56.310
Akanbe!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:00.950
Happy!

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:03.720
We are not...

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.920
...going to lose!

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:08.290
Precure...

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.930
Sunny Fire!

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.030
Precure...

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.330
Peace...

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.970
Thunder!

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:20.710
Precure...

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:25.710
March Shoot!

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:27.540
Precure...

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:31.610
Beauty...

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.580
Blizzard!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.360
Aka...

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.740
Akanbe!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:52.940
Curse you, you wretched Precures!

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.120
That's the final Décor-kuru!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.520
It's a Sunflower Décor! How cute!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.810
And that's the full set, right?

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.000
Hooray!

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:24.070
So, what should we do now?

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:28.540
Place the sixteenth Cure Décor into the Décor Decor-de gozaru.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:33.240
That will awaken Märchenland's Queen-de gozaru!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:36.280
We're finally going to revive the Queen!

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.950
Go ahead, Pop!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.850
As you wish-de gozaru.

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:43.420
Now, our wish can finally come true-de gozaru.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:45.960
And it's all thanks to you-de gozaru.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:48.720
You have my heartfelt gratitude-de gozaru.

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:50.730
Hurry up and put it in-kuru!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.010
Who are you?!

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.100
Give back the Décor Decor-de gozaru!

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:05.110
We finally got the last one, and now...!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:08.330
Well, haven't you been busy bees?

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:11.860
But I'm afraid we're about to have all the Bad Energy we need...

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:15.180
The time for the revival of King Pierrot is upon us!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:18.220
You're from the Bad End Kingdom!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:22.890
Candy!

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:24.260
Kuru!

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:27.090
Let me go-kuru!

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:29.130
Candy!

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.100
Give Candy back!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.200
Miyuki!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:35.180
Your wishes will come true?

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:40.740
That won't be happening, I'm afraid. Your wishes were nothing but false hopes in the face of despair.

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:41.760
Kuru!

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.480
Miyuki!

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:45.180
Girls!

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.150
Candy!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.280
Candy!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.480
Candy!

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:03.320
<i>I hope I can play with Miyuki and her friends forever-kuru!</i>

00:23:39.580 --> 00:23:41.360
They kidnapped Candy!

00:23:41.360 --> 00:23:43.570
This is no time for mopin'! We've gotta save her!

00:23:43.570 --> 00:23:45.190
But this Joker...

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.190
It's obvious that he's a most dangerous adversary.

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:51.140
If, I mean, <i>if</i> we lost... what would happen to us?

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:54.180
I think we have to consider exactly what is at stake here.

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:57.150
Why exactly we became Precure...

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.550
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:04.450
Find your ultra happy smile!
